  "question": {
    "text": "A conductor lies along the z-axis at <math> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>1.5</mtext> <mo>&#8804;</mo> <mtext>z</mtext> <mo>&#60;</mo><mtext>1.5</mtext> <mo>m</mo> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;and carries a fixed current of 10.0 A in <math> <mrow> <msub> <mrow> <mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"> <mtext>a</mtext> <mo>^</mo> </mover> </mrow> <mtext>z</mtext> </msub> </mrow> </math> &nbsp;direction (see figure). For a field <math> <mrow> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mtext>B</mtext> <mo>&#8594;</mo> </mover> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>3.0</mtext> <mo>&#215;</mo> <mn>1</mn> <msup> <mn>0</mn> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>4</mn> </mrow> </msup> <msup> <mtext>&#160;e</mtext> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>0.2x&#160;</mtext> </mrow> </msup> <msub> <mrow> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mtext>a</mtext> <mo>^</mo> </mover> </mrow> <mtext>y</mtext> </msub> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;T, find the power required to move the conductor at constant speed to x = 2.0 m, y = 0 m in <math> <mrow> <mn>5</mn> <mo>&#215;</mo> <mn>1</mn> <msup> <mn>0</mn> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </msup> <mtext>&#160;s</mtext> </mrow> </math>. Assume parallel motion along the x-axis.<br /><br />&nbsp; &nbsp;<u><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/EM0025739_Question.jpg\" style=\"width: 385px; height: 234px;\" /></strong></u>",
